css-loader-generator.formula:
animation: <name> <duration>s <timing-function> infinite;

Example: animation: css-loader-spin 1s linear infinite;
Border width = max(2, round(size / 10)) px

css-loader-generator.workedExample:
Choose the spinner style with size 48 px, color #4f46e5, and speed 1 second.

Border width = max(2, round(48 / 10)) = 5 px.
The track ring becomes rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2) and the spinning edge takes the full #4f46e5.

Generated rule:
.css-loader {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  border: 5px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
  border-top-color: #4f46e5;
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: css-loader-spin 1s linear infinite;
}

Paste this CSS plus <div class="css-loader"></div> into any page and the loader spins immediately.
